<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten stocks fell, three rose and six were flat in 25.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,707.3 points, 1.4 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were up 0.6 percent in a 32.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
